  "abstract": "<jats:p>We demonstrate the first Nyquist super-channel transmission using silicon microring-based I/Q modulators. A net bit rate of 612.9 Gbps per polarization is achieved back-to-back and exceeds 500 Gbps after 20 km using two wavelength sub-carriers.</jats:p>",
